WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.067
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.102
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.136
We hope you're
doing well tonight,

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.405
and now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.107
In a new interview,
former vice president Mike Pence

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.143
criticized President Biden
and said that he is

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.813
"embracing the politics
of the radical left."

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.114
Are you kidding me?

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:18.084
If anything, he falls
pretty hard to the right.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.986
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:26.026
In the same interview,
former vice president Mike Pence

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.493
said that after
the Capitol attack,

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.463
he talked through it
with former president Trump,

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:32.631
and then they
"rolled our sleeves up

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:33.999
and finished working together."

00:00:33.999 --> 00:00:35.701
I don't buy it.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.303
The only way Trump ever
rolled his sleeves up

00:00:38.303 --> 00:00:40.306
was to sell a fake Rolex.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.208
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.310
Pence also said in the interview
that he will

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.979
"always be proud to have served

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.647
alongside former
president Trump,"

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:51.117
because in the end,
there is no bond stronger

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.785
than Stockholm syndrome.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.854
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:57.890
President Biden spent the day
yesterday at the beach.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.593
And when there was only one set
of footprints,

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.295
that's when Jill carried him.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.097
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:08.901
Former president Trump said
in a new interview

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.671
that he has not asked
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.640
if he is running for president
in 2024

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.909
but added that he thinks
he would win over DeSantis.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.944
Well, there's only one way
to find out --

00:01:18.944 --> 00:01:21.314
a long, nasty,
drawn-out primary season

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.782
where you two guys
are both emotionally

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.150
and politically eviscerated,

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.452
debating each other's last
brain cell into the ground,

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:27.920
destroying the Republican Party

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.421
and everything
you both stand for

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:32.958
until there is only one husk of
a man left standing in the GOP

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:34.827
to actually run
in the election...

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:35.995
Jeb!

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.663
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.298
There you go!

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:44.404
A rare -- a rare
round of applause for Jeb.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.509
American Airlines has announced

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:53.279
that it will no longer
service Toledo, Ohio,

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.513
due to a pilot shortage,

00:01:54.513 --> 00:01:56.315
despite being the only
commercial carrier

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:57.349
to service the city.

00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:59.518
So if you have to go to Toledo,

00:01:59.518 --> 00:02:01.788
I have even more bad news.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.523
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.994
A man in the U.K.
said in a new interview

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:12.331
that he drank 30 cans of Pepsi
a day for 20 years

00:02:12.331 --> 00:02:15.434
but ended his addiction
after doing hypnotherapy.

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:18.938
Man, that guy must have been
hard to hypnotize.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.673
"You're getting very sleepy."

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.842
"I'm really not!

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:26.145
I'm really not, though.
I'm wide awake."

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.614
That's right --
A man in the U.K.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:32.084
said that he drank 30 cans
of Pepsi a day for 20 years.

00:02:32.084 --> 00:02:37.123
Even crazier, another man in
the U.K. has had RC Cola twice.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:38.992
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:47.233
If there's any RC Cola fans
in Toledo watching tonight,

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.535
it's a --

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:51.704
Apologies.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.807
Today was actor
Jussie Smollett's 40th birthday.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.842
At least he says it is.

00:02:56.842 --> 00:02:59.712
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:02.649
Move over, RC Cola joke.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.317
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.585 --> 00:03:08.954
And finally,
according to new data,

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:10.356
the price of a pound of lettuce

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.959
has increased by more than 11%
in a year.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:15.695
To give you an idea of what
a pound of lettuce looks like,

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:17.263
order a Big Mac.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:18.831
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.900
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

